      "id": "s2",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pan_route",
      "narration": "Before, sailing from New York to San Francisco meant going all the way around South America: about twenty-two thousand five hundred kilometers.",
      "on_screen_text": "Around South America: 22,500 km",
      "highlight_words": [
        "22,500"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pan_shortcut",
      "narration": "Since nineteen fourteen, the Panama Canal has cut that trip to about nine thousand five hundred.",
      "on_screen_text": "With the canal: 9,500 km",
      "highlight_words": [
        "9,500"
      ],
      "sfx": "ding",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pan_profile",
      "narration": "But the canal isn't flat: in the middle there's a lake twenty-six meters above sea level.",
      "on_screen_text": "A lake 26 m up",
      "highlight_words": [
        "26"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pan_enter",
      "narration": "To go up, the ship enters a lock: a giant chamber with gates.",
      "on_screen_text": "Into the lock",
      "highlight_words": [
        "lock"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pan_fill",
      "narration": "They close the gates and let lake water flow in, no pumps, just gravity, and the ship rises like in an elevator.",
      "on_screen_text": "Up like an elevator",
      "highlight_words": [
        "elevator"
      ],
      "sfx": "bubbles",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pan_steps",
      "narration": "Three steps like that lift it up to the lake, and three more lower it into the other ocean.",
      "on_screen_text": "Three steps up",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Three"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "surprise",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pan_water",
      "narration": "And every ship through the old locks uses about two hundred million liters of fresh water, which ends up in the sea.",
      "on_screen_text": "200 million liters",
      "highlight_words": [
        "200"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
